            <p>Passengers arriving from Austin proceed through UK entry controls. </p>
            <h4>Requirements: </h4>
            <ul>
                <li>Valid passport</li>
                <li>Electronic Travel Authorization (ETA) for US citizens (once fully implemented)</li>
                <li>Proof of accommodation for border inspection</li>
                <li>Return or onward travel documentation</li>
                <li>Sufficient funds for intended stay</li>
            </ul>
            <p>US citizens enjoy visa-free access for tourism stays up to six months. </p>
